 1\n\nRoot (Taurus) 00:00–24:00\nMoon: descending — PLANTING TIME (tran
 splant\, prune\, compost\, soil work)\n\nSow: maincrop potatoes\, carrots
 \, beetroot\, parsnips\, radish\nFruit trees: thin fruit\nSoil: Good for c
 ompost making/spreading\, cultivation and weeding. Cuttings root well now.
  Hoeing today benefits root crops.\n⛔ Avoid: 22:00–24:00 perigee (Moon
  closest to Earth). No sowing\, planting or grafting then — use it for t
 ool care\, paths and planning.
